<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro for smooth in-air strafing (forward-left and forward-right) to maintain momentum. Movement-only; no shooting or ADS.

</Description>
    <Comment>How to use:

Assign to a key you can comfortably hold (Alt, Shift, or Middle Mouse).

Jump near a wall or in open space and hold the key.

Character will smoothly alternate left/right in air, mimicking a neo-strafe.

Tip: If it feels too fast or slow, tweak Wait times in 10–20ms increments until it matches your style.

Made by JROCC</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 60 ms
KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 26 1
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 40 ms
KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 26 1
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 40 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>